Just another social share plugin. Simple but flexible.

== Description ==

Social-share share the data.

== Changelog == 

= social-share Needs Your Support =

It is hard to continue development and support for this free plugin without contributions from users like you. If you enjoy using Social-share and find it useful, please consider [__making a donation__](https://dhrup.com/donate/). Your donation will help encourage and support the plugin's continued development and better user support.

= Features =

 * An options to add Custom Image of social button.
 * Floating Sidebar
 * Share Buttons to every post/page
 * Show/Hide options for any buttons
 * An options to set the position of Social Buttons (Left/Right)
 * Advance feature of pinterest share buttons to share images.
 * An option to auto close sidebar buttons on page load
 * An option to hide "Share This!!" button on page/post
 * An option to define share buttons postion (above content/below content)

== Installation ==

1. Upload the entire `Social-share` folder to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.

